    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1103">

                <pb facs="0966" n="862" xml:id="pg862"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/9808.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Ambassador to
                            Spain to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-11-18T14:00:00+00:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 18, 1913—2 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s November 10, 2 p.m.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d1103-f1"/> The Spanish
                    Cabinet is still considering the subject thereof and may continue indefinitely.
                    The German Ambassador and the French Chargé d’Affaires here tell me that their
                    respective Governments will take no independent action and each is in accord
                    with our Government.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Willard</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
